{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Air Traffic Control</strong> is a dynamic aviation game where you guide airplanes and helicopters safely to their destinations. Tap and drag to create precise landing routes, ensuring smooth operations in busy skies.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/air-traffic-control.gif?t=1740555374\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Draw Your Flight Paths</strong><br>Get creative as you map out flight routes for incoming aircraft. Watch your planes follow your directions\u2014whether it's a masterpiece or pure chaos.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/2.png?t=1740555374\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master Multitasking</strong><br>Skillfully manage multiple aircraft at once, avoiding mid-air collisions and keeping traffic flowing. Plan ahead to handle the pressure of managing a bustling airspace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/3.png?t=1740555374\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore Multiple Zones</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from various themed airspace areas and airports, each with unique layouts and challenges.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365130/extras/image.png?t=1740555374\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How many planes and choppers can you guide to a perfect landing?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365130?t=1740555374","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3365130?t=1740555374","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstati